/*!
\page page_sttofrawdata StTofRawData

\brief Raw TDC hit record from the STAR legacy TOF detector electronics (Run 5+).

\section tofrawdata_overview Overview

StTofRawData stores a single raw TDC hit from the STAR legacy TOF detector electronics
introduced in Run 5 (2004).
Unlike the earlier \ref StTofData format, this class records whether the edge is leading or
trailing (\c mLeTeFlag), the tray number, and an optional trigger-time TDC count.

\note For Run 8 and later BTOF data, use \ref StBTofRawHit instead.

Objects are stored in \ref StTofCollection via StEvent::tofCollection().

\section tofrawdata_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code{.txt}
TObject → StObject → StTofRawData
\endcode

\section tofrawdata_members Data Members

| Member | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|
| mLeTeFlag | UShort_t | Edge flag: 1 = leading, 2 = trailing |
| mTray | UShort_t | Tray number (0 = unassigned) |
| mChannel | UShort_t | TDC channel number |
| mTdc | UInt_t | Raw TDC count |
| mTriggertime | UInt_t | Trigger time TDC count (event offset) |
| mQuality | UShort_t | Data quality flag |

\section tofrawdata_methods Key Methods

- leteFlag() — leading/trailing edge flag (1=leading, 2=trailing)
- tray() — tray number
- channel() — TDC channel number
- tdc() — raw TDC count
- triggertime() — trigger time TDC count
- quality() — data quality flag

\section tofrawdata_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
StTofCollection* coll = event->tofCollection();
if (coll) {
    const StSPtrVecTofRawData& raw = coll->tofRawData();
    for (const auto& r : raw) {
        bool isLE   = (r->leteFlag() == 1);
        unsigned short chan = r->channel();
        unsigned int   tdc  = r->tdc();
    }
}
\endcode

\see StTofData, StTofCell, StBTofRawHit, StTofCollection
*/
